      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} Yes the game has improved less lag, even by myself, the mic is clearer to others, but also the phone has upgraded from Android 13 to 14 during this time. I still have the same 6 GB  and same Samsung A52. \n\nI would like to have an option like a warning before switching to a very poor avatar. I don't use the phone too often like in the beginning because of this unless away from home or when a new update comes out.\n\nEveryone else being shown in fallback did contribute back then to lag, but I do have about 5 max in fallback now when with others. When alone it doesn't lag or crash unless phone is warm. Also have used this same phone with Pokémon Go for a lot longer with battery pack.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
